WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.070
The single-minded proposition is the one idea your ad must say.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.794
Just one, an invitation not a claim, repeated in new ways.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.300
In the meeting, the client wants to say everything: cheaper, faster, greener, tastier.

00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:17.722
The creative's eyes glaze over.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:22.805
Baxter's rule: fifteen words or fewer, and the best billboards use six.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:23.666
Powerful wash in cold water.

00:00:23.716 --> 00:00:26.631
Instantly clear.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:29.417
So cut every message down to one,

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:30.267
make it an invitation,

00:00:29.798 --> 00:00:33.411
and repeat it until it's yours.
